<!--
  The "nothing coming up" mark for the widgets.

  A crossed-out alarm clock, drawn as a vector so it can be tinted at render time to the
  widget's own muted text colour — the widgets resolve their palette from the night-mode
  configuration, so a baked-in grey would be wrong in one of the two themes.

  Deliberately an icon rather than more text: an empty widget previously showed only the
  words "אין שעמור", which reads as easily as a widget that has failed to load as one
  that is correctly telling you there is nothing set.
-->
